    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. but i've heard a lot of people just call these arguments \"NIMBYism\" to dismiss them. is there any actual substance to the complaints about infrastructure and school overcrowding, or is it mostly just people being selfish about their neighborhood?",
